{"id":"n26902-1-11","stage":1,"title":"천천히 · 慢慢地","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26902-1-11-1","ko":"여기 카메라 팔죠?","zh":"这里有卖相机吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"카메라","meaning":"照相机","explanation":"카메라：照相机","readings":[{"term":"카메라","audio":"/audio/6e2b53040cd15b607281.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57332","senseId":"1","lemma":"카메라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"팔죠?","meaning":"卖，出售","explanation":"팔다：卖，出售；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"팔다","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71482","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"6e2b53040cd15b60","term":"카메라","zh":"照相机","audio":"/audio/6e2b53040cd15b607281.mp3","entryId":"57332","definition":"照相用的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"2aa6e349da8a806d","term":"팔다","zh":"卖，出售","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3","entryId":"71482","definition":"收取钱财将物品或权利交给对方或提供劳动力等。","pronunciation":["팔다"]}],"audio":"/audio/05f83c1908741bd98736.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26902-1-11-2","ko":"가게 안에 더 많이 있으니 천천히 둘러보세요.","zh":"店里还有更多，您可以慢慢看看。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가게","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안에","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있으니","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"천천히","meaning":"慢慢地，缓慢地","explanation":"천천히：慢慢地，缓慢地","readings":[{"term":"천천히","audio":"/audio/71c0b7db98a074453c87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26902","senseId":"1","lemma":"천천히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"둘러보세요.","meaning":"环视，环顾","explanation":"둘러보다：环视，环顾；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"둘러보다","audio":"/audio/040d6724c4a643c6e173.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61340","senseId":"1","lemma":"둘러보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"里，里面","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"74890","definition":"从某物体或空间的周围向着中间的方向；或指那样的部分。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio